OL,3,ATrump signs order to rename Lake
OL,4,AOntario as Lake America
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has signed an
OL,7,Fexecutive order seeking to change the
OL,8,Fname of Lake Ontario to Lake America.
OL,10,FThe move comes after trade talks
OL,11,Fbetween the US and Canada collapsed
OL,12,Flast week, and the US imposed new 50%
OL,13,Ftariffs on $20bn (C$28bn) worth of
OL,14,FCanadian goods. Canada will implement
OL,15,F"dollar for dollar" counter tariffs
OL,16,Fnext month.
OL,18,FTrump said on Thursday the move was
OL,19,F"official, effective immediately" and
OL,20,Fthat his administration has "filed all
OL,21,Fthe necessary papers" to rename the
OL,22,Flake, which straddles both countries.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
