OL,3,ATrump signs order to rename Lake
OL,4,AOntario as Lake America
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn response, Canadian Prime Minister
OL,7,FMark Carney said "things must be called
OL,8,Fby their name, and this lake is called
OL,9,FLake Ontario ` today and forever".
